<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS6" title="In 4.3 Main Results and Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Robustness via Referencing: Defending against Prompt Injection Attacks by Referencing the Executed Instruction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3.6 </span>Defending Against Gradient-Based Attacks</span></a></li>
